{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_adr_0151", "label": "ADR-0151", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IInvoicingConnector answers every call with a ConnectorResult (Ok/Rejected/Reauthorise/Unavailable/Unknown), never an exception; the InvoiceRequest's own id is the idempotency key so a lost response is reconciled by lookup before any retry; PaidDate is read from the connector and never set by this platform."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_iinvoicingconnector", "label": "IInvoicingConnector", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CreateDraftInvoiceAsync, ReadStatusAsync, FindByReferenceAsync, ListContactsAsync, AuthorisationStateAsync; a thrown exception out of an implementation is a defect in it."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_connectorresult", "label": "ConnectorResult<T>", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IEvidenceService's refusal-as-result discipline widened to the five states a network call genuinely has."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_request_id_is_idempotency_key", "label": "Request Id Is the Idempotency Key", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SendAsync passes InvoiceRequest.Id itself, never a per-attempt value; every connector writes it into the invoice's reference field, so a timeout after the accounting system committed can never produce a second invoice."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_paid_is_read_never_set", "label": "Paid Is Read, Never Set", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not ERP (D-028): no ledger, no tax computation, no payment processing; PaidDate has no mutator, service method or command that sets it other than from the connector."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_invoicerequest", "label": "InvoiceRequest", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Follows Evidence's shape; currency resolved from the project's pinned rate card, not Organisation.TradingCurrency; lines are TimesheetEntry/DeliverableCompletion at the rate ADR-0150 froze."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_invoicerequeststatus", "label": "InvoiceRequestStatus", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nine values; Unavailable is declared because the Work Package row names it but never stored \u2014 a connector-unreachable send reverts to Draft."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_invoicingservice", "label": "InvoicingService", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decides permission and lifecycle before InvoiceRequest's mutators run; RaiseFromCompletionAsync refuses AlreadyInvoiced/NothingToBill against every live request so a source is billed on at most one live request."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_isecretstore", "label": "ISecretStore", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeps connector tokens out of tempest.db under <root>/secrets/, one file per SHA-256-hashed key; WindowsDpapiSecretStore encrypts per Windows user, FileSecretStore is a disclosed unencrypted fallback with a logged Warning."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_invoicereconciliationservice", "label": "InvoiceReconciliationService", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IHostedService polling every Invoicing:PollMinutes (default 15) on a TimeProvider-built timer; every failure caught and logged, non-critical."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_oauthauthoriser", "label": "OAuthAuthoriser", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Authorisation-code flow with PKCE for both providers over an HttpListener loopback; client id/secret from configuration then ISecretStore, never the database; EnsureAccessTokenAsync refreshes silently and answers Reauthorise rather than crashing."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_xeroconnector", "label": "XeroConnector", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "/api.xro/2.0/Invoices and /Contacts with Idempotency-Key; \u00a79's contact-by-name and reconcile-by-Reference superseded by ADR-0162 (ContactID, invoice number)."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_quickbooksonlineconnector", "label": "QuickBooksOnlineConnector", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Must resolve a CustomerRef first; synthesises a status word from Balance/TotalAmt/EmailStatus; DeriveDocNumber yields a stable 21-character TOS- number for the 21-character DocNumber limit."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_connectorhttpoutcome", "label": "ConnectorHttpOutcome", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One shared mapping: 2xx Ok; 400/422 Rejected; 401/403 Reauthorise; 429/5xx and transport failure Unavailable; unparseable 2xx body Unknown."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_fakeinvoicingconnector", "label": "FakeInvoicingConnector", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The default binding (Invoicing:Connector unset or Fake); records every call, scriptable per call."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_deliverableservice_completion_hook", "label": "DeliverableService.SetCompletionHook", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A plain Func wired once by EngineeringWorkspaceComposer so completing a deliverable raises an invoice request through the service without a circular compile-time dependency; refusals swallowed \u2014 completion succeeded when its write committed."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_oauth_loopback_port_48131", "label": "OAuth Loopback Port 48131", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Invoicing:OAuth:LoopbackPort, 48131 by default (49301 before the v1.0.0 candidate, TD-183); the exact redirect URI to register is http://127.0.0.1:48131/callback/; a bound port returns OAuthResult.Failed naming port and key."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_request_and_line_links_not_atomic", "label": "Request and Line Links Are Not Atomic", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "EngineeringDomainContext.ExecuteWriteAsync commits one object per call (ADR-0145); InvoicedBy links are written after the request reaches Sent, each in its own transaction \u2014 disclosed, recoverable by re-running the link."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_xeroidempotencykey", "label": "XeroIdempotencyKey", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Since v0.24.0 the Idempotency-Key is derived from request, operation and body, so a changed draft is a new request and a repeat is replayed."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_invoicing_connector_selection", "label": "Invoicing:Connector Selection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-0151-the-connector-seam-is-a-result-never-an-exception-the-requests-own-id-is-the-idempotency-key-paid-is-read-never-set.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fake (default) | Xero | QuickBooksOnline chosen at TempestHost composition; construction never fails over a missing client id because resolution is lazy per call."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_adr_0151_the_connector_seam_is_a_result_never_an_exception_the_requests_own_id_is_the_idempotency_key_paid_is_read_never_set_adr_0151", "target": "docs_governance_architecture_adr_register_adr_0150", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_